---
title: Devices
description: How your devices are registered and revoked.
---

A NeoWorks account can be active on many devices. When you sign in on a new device, it
registers a device record with a name and kind. Each device keeps its own protected copy of
your account key, which never leaves the device.

## Authenticator

The authenticator app can hold your account key behind biometrics and hand it to a new
browser by QR code, so you do not have to type your password on every device.

## Revocation

You can revoke any device from your dashboard. Revocation ends that device's sessions.
